[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3860076988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115915#issuecomment-3860076988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115915","id":3860076988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mFBm8","user":{"login":"Toxe","id":1238638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzg2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1238638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe","html_url":"https://github.com/Toxe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Toxe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-06T12:10:08Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T12:10:08Z","body":"I tried it with the MRP and a more complex project of mine and it works and does not seem to cause other issues. 👍\r\n\r\nAlthough personally I would change the code slightly to make things a little more readable IMHO and to better show intent. From this:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\t\tif (is_sub_viewport() && !is_attached_in_viewport() && viewport_textures.size() > 0) {\r\n\t\t\tVector2 pos = me->get_position();\r\n\t\t\tbool inside = (pos.x >= 0 && pos.y >= 0 && pos.x < size.width && pos.y < size.height);\r\n\t\t\tif (inside && !gui.mouse_in_viewport) {\r\n\t\t\t\tnotify_mouse_entered();\r\n\t\t\t} else if (!inside && gui.mouse_in_viewport) {\r\n\t\t\t\tnotify_mouse_exited();\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nTo this (only the first 3 lines changed):\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\t\tif (is_sub_viewport() && !is_attached_in_viewport() && !viewport_textures.is_empty()) {\r\n\t\t\tconst Rect2 r(Point2(), size);\r\n\t\t\tconst bool inside = r.has_point(me->get_position());\r\n\t\t\tif (inside && !gui.mouse_in_viewport) {\r\n\t\t\t\tnotify_mouse_entered();\r\n\t\t\t} else if (!inside && gui.mouse_in_viewport) {\r\n\t\t\t\tnotify_mouse_exited();\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso I wonder if we should call `Viewport::get_visible_rect()` instead of `Rect2 r(Point2(), size)`? But I don't know enough about the engine.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3860076988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3861464445","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115915#issuecomment-3861464445","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115915","id":3861464445,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mKUV9","user":{"login":"MaxiSanc37","id":39122872,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MTIyODcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39122872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37","html_url":"https://github.com/MaxiSanc37","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxiSanc37/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"ht